{"title":"2022 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/0/5e06aebe15aa63bf6095e81cac6dbe8333cdbe0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2 + 7}} = \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"107\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because the numerators of the fractions are equal and the fractions themselves are also equal, the denominators must be equal. This means that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/7/24759e10d29625b150ef8b293480d692351ad306.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x^{2} + 7} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"99\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/5/21555e4dab07c339c5167de8142226409e9c72f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} + 7 = 4^{2} = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5d72c2515bf58cf3fcac8da3f18009d849bad1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2} = 16 - 7 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/b/54b9b87c689ebbbdae545f54ca400fdbe3c6daf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\pm \\sqrt{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddf82c45c1241a963ba5e2b4d74780dfa225daa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/b/56bdb35c682856e5689f49de6aa819a3a51b005d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = -3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"71\" height=\"26\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018021617\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 38/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1506/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.961      1 2022_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    5.961      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36001:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018021617 and revision id 279601. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>